size 100 10
start
clipboard set s-clip
keys <Tab> <CR>
keys p
frame a-frame
file todo.txt a-file
-- config.toml --
show_detail = false
-- todo.txt --
A +x
B +y
-- s-clip --
Buy +y
-- a-frame --
┌Projects────┐┌ +x ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│>+x      1/1││  1       A                                                            +x           │
│ +y      2/2││  2       Buy                                                          +y  filtered │
├Contexts────┤│                                                                                    │
│            ││                                                                                    │
├Filters─────┤│                                                                                    │
│ [x] Done   ││                                                                                    │
│ [ ] Later  ││                                                                                    │
└────────────┘└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  pasted 1 item; hidden by current filters once you move  x done  t state
-- a-file --
A +x
2026-09-29 Buy +y
B +y
